{
  "kind": "konomi-tongue.light.barrier",
  "v": 1,
  "why": "The fixed corpus for claims B1–B4: classic, publicly documented test inputs in the languages an attacker shares with an ordinary target, plus well-formed standard documents. Data only: the measurement sends each one to a LIGHT door as raw bytes (B1), carries each one inside a correctly signed LIGHT packet (B3), and renders each one at the page's edge (B4).",
